  <h2>Choose the linking pattern</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="practice" data-choice-gap-drill data-success-message="Correct. You selected as, at, in, for, or from by identifying the exact information after work.">
    <h3>Drill 1: use the stated focus</h3>
    <p class="choice-hint">Read the label in parentheses. It removes the possible at/in overlap and gives one intended answer.</p>
    <div class="choice-bank" aria-label="Work pattern choices">
      <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="as">as</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="at">at</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="in">in</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="for">for</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="from">from</button>
    </div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">1</span><span>Nia works <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="as" data-hint="As introduces the role nurse." data-fix="Nia works as a nurse." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> a nurse. <span class="contraction">(role)</span></span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">2</span><span>Nia works <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="at" data-hint="At presents Northside Clinic as the named workplace point." data-fix="Nia works at Northside Clinic." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> Northside Clinic. <span class="contraction">(named workplace)</span></span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">3</span><span>Zoe works <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="in" data-hint="In introduces the accounting department inside the organization." data-fix="Zoe works in the accounting department." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> the accounting department. <span class="contraction">(department)</span></span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">4</span><span>Dev works <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="for" data-hint="For introduces the employer SunTech." data-fix="Dev works for SunTech." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> SunTech. <span class="contraction">(employer)</span></span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">5</span><span>On Fridays, Dev works <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="from" data-hint="The remote-work chunk is work from home." data-fix="On Fridays, Dev works from home." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> home. <span class="contraction">(remote arrangement)</span></span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">6</span><span>Rosa works <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="in" data-hint="In introduces the field of auto repair." data-fix="Rosa works in auto repair." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> auto repair. <span class="contraction">(field)</span></span></div>
    <div class="drill-actions"><button class="lesson-btn" data-check-choices>Check</button><button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-choices>Reset</button></div>
    <p class="feedback" data-feedback></p>
  </div>

