  <h2>Notice and repair errors</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="nurse" data-hint="One singular role after be needs a or an." data-fix="I’m a nurse." data-why="Nurse is one singular countable role, so it needs the article a after I’m.">
    <h3>Drill 5: repair the missing article</h3>
    <p>In the sentence “I’m nurse,” tap the word that needs an article before it.</p>
    <div class="spot-options"><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="i'm">I’m</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="nurse">nurse.</button></div>
    <p class="hidden-answer" data-error-feedback></p>
  </div>

  <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="work" data-hint="The subject He requires the third-person singular present form." data-fix="He works in the billing department." data-why="For he or she in the present simple, work adds -s: he works.">
    <h3>Drill 6: repair the verb for he</h3>
    <p>In the sentence “He work in the billing department,” tap the one word to change.</p>
    <div class="spot-options"><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="he">He</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="work">work</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="in">in</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="department">the billing department.</button></div>
    <p class="hidden-answer" data-error-feedback></p>
  </div>

  <div class="micro-drill" data-transform>
