      <div class="transform-item" data-transform-item><p class="transform-cue"><b>3</b> Zoe · department: accounting</p><button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button><p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>Zoe works in the accounting department.</strong></p></div>
      <div class="transform-item" data-transform-item><p class="transform-cue"><b>4</b> Dev · employer: SunTech</p><button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button><p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>Dev works for SunTech.</strong></p></div>
